<view class="tech-page"><view class="tech-head"><view><view class="tech-title">接单大厅</view><view class="tech-subtitle">选择合适的任务，认真做好每一次服务</view></view><view class="tech-avatar"><van-icon name="orders-o" size="28px" /></view></view>
<view wx:for="{{pending}}" wx:key="id" class="tech-notice" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-order="{{item.orderId}}" bindtap="onOpen"><van-icon name="info-o" /><text>有一笔接单结果待确认，点击恢复原操作</text><van-icon name="arrow" /></view>
<tech-state wx:if="{{loading}}" loading /><tech-state wx:elif="{{error}}" error title="接单大厅暂未同步" description="{{error}}" action="重新读取" bind:retry="load" /><block wx:else><view class="pool-intro"><van-icon name="shield-o" /><text>先核对上门时段 · 接单即确认预约</text></view>
<view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="tech-card pool-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-order="{{item.workOrderId}}" bindtap="onOpen"><view class="pool-top"><view class="pool-device"><van-icon name="setting-o" /><text>{{item.title}}维修</text></view><text class="tech-tag">可抢单</text></view><view class="pool-symptom">{{item.symptomSummary}}</view><view class="pool-area"><van-icon name="location-o" /> {{item.serviceAreaText||'区域待平台核实'}}</view><view class="pool-slot"><van-icon name="calendar-o" size="16px" /><text>{{item.slotText}}</text></view><view class="pool-bottom"><text>{{item.timeText}} 发布</text><view>查看任务 <van-icon name="arrow" size="12px" /></view></view></view>
<tech-state wx:if="{{!items.length}}" title="暂时没有可接订单" description="平台发布新订单后，会出现在这里。
你也可以在“我的工单”处理定向任务。" />
<view wx:if="{{loadingMore}}" class="tech-bottom-note">正在读取更多订单…</view><button wx:if="{{moreError}}" class="tech-link" bindtap="onReachBottom">{{moreError}} · 重试</button><view wx:if="{{items.length && !more}}" class="tech-bottom-note">已显示当前可接订单 · 下拉可刷新</view></block></view>
